    "Real Image Search URL": "https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=The+Gateway+Hotel+Akota+Gardens+Vadodara+Vadodara+hotel+exterior",
    "Image Status": "Real-image search link; licensing/source should be verified before reuse",
